{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NVoNGmibw5W66iAJyHERrH","type":"tool_result","content":"## Readiness gaps\n\nRanking (D20 post-run): priority 1 = plausible D21-D23 question with no extractor (or a wrong-answer bug in an existing one), or a harness blocker that silently fails a\nwhole family of prebuilds. TARGETS-style `fmt`/`fields` given in `detail` for prebuild items.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": \"macho-fat-slice-sets\", \"concept\": \"Mach-O universal/fat per-slice SET fields (cputype/cpusubtype sets, slice table, fat_arch vs slice-header mismatch)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D20 GM field `macho.cpu_type_set` = compact JSON list of `\\\"0x%08x\\\"` cputypes (thin -> one element `[\\\"0x0100000c\\\"]`,\n  {\"id\": \"ar-static-archives\", \"concept\": \"Unix `ar` archives (.a static libs, universal .a, Windows .lib) members and object architectures\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D20 flavor 'thin and universal binaries mixed with archives'. fmt ar (aliases archive, static_lib, a, lib): magic `!<arch>\\\\n` @0 (also thin\n  {\"id\": \"macos-xar-pkg-dmg\", \"concept\": \"macOS installer containers: xar `.pkg`, flat-package TOC, DMG koly trailer\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt pkg (aliases xar, macos_pkg): header `xar!` (78 61 72 21) BE: header_size u16 @4, version u16 @6, toc_length_compressed u64 @8, toc_length_uncompressed u64 @16\n  {\"id\": \"macos-app-bundle-plist\", \"concept\": \"Zipped `.app` / `.framework` bundles: Info.plist advertised architectures and minimum OS vs the real binary\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D20 'identify what truly supports the advertised fleet'. fmt app (aliases app_bundle, bundle, macos_app; also plist fields un\n  {\"id\": \"macho-fleet-synthesis\", \"concept\": \"Cross-file architecture-support synthesis over Mach-O / fat / ar / ELF / PE members\", \"priority\": 1, \"acti