Tools installed: exiftool, poppler, qpdf, mutool, pdf-parser, pdfid, pngcheck, zsteg, steghide, binwalk, foremost,\n  mediainfo, sqlite3, ImageMagick, readelf/objdump, aapt + apktool/jadx (`source bin/env.sh`), olevba/oleid, olefile,\n  pefile, pyelftools, LnkParse3, dnfile, mutagen, androguard (.venv; androguard is gate-allowed in-window); msitools\n  under tools/msitools; ffmpeg 7.0.2 (no ffprobe) at `tools/imageio_ffmpeg_pkg/imageio_ffmpeg/binaries/\n  ffmpeg-linux-x86_64-v7.0.2` (not on PATH). NOT installed: ffprobe, sox.\n'''\ns=s[:i]+new\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nwc -l reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md; source bin/env.sh 2>/dev/null; which aapt apktool jadx"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5812,"cache_read_input_tokens":105305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5812},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9641bc75-74e7-43ea-9891-be166854c1b9","uuid":"67ba9992-6929-4073-9183-debeb55df09d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:20:53.870Z","request_id":"req_011CgFT78trJhoxG1Kx87AZP","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017X9R5bexaork1eUTMQ22x8":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"## Pitfalls that cost time\")\nnew='''## Pitfalls that cost time\n- **Synthesis dispatch** (lost D15, D16, D17, D19 -> `solver_incomplete` -> ~1 min offline generalize per mode): the\n  timed kit always adds `metadata-day-NN-synthesis-sha256-order`. Use the lane seed (`local_answer` +\n  `synthesis_answer` -> `lib.meta.synthesis.digest_order`, artifacts root set INSIDE `_solve_pairs`; Mastery forks one\n  process per set) and only add today's field -- D18, D20, D21 